    "body": "Yep, this is intentional. The idea is that if the web page is \"at the limit\", we can't give it a chance to prevent the close request from going through, as that would push it \"over the limit\". Whereas if there's extra wiggle room between the current number of groups and the limit, then we're good to allow a potential prevention.",
